1d:["$","div",null,{"className":"case-shots","style":{"viewTransitionName":"case-media-askcart"},"children":[["$","figure","/images/projects/askcart-home.webp",{"className":"case-shot","children":[["$","$L31",null,{"src":"/images/projects/askcart-home.webp","alt":"The home: one search, one ask — the guided follow-up replaces the dead end.","width":1280,"height":800,"sizes":"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px","priority":true}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"01"}],"The home: one search, one ask — the guided follow-up replaces the dead end."]}]]}],["$","figure","/images/projects/askcart-guided.webp",{"className":"case-shot","children":[["$","$L31",null,{"src":"/images/projects/askcart-guided.webp","alt":"The misspelled query “Shadhi Gift” still lands: one question — budget, for whom, occasion, material, style — narrows it and the results re-rank.","width":1200,"height":1050,"sizes":"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px","priority":false}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"02"}],"The misspelled query “Shadhi Gift” still lands: one question — budget, for whom, occasion, material, style — narrows it and the results re-rank."]}]]}],["$","figure","/images/projects/askcart-analytics.webp",{"className":"case-shot","children":[["$","$L31",null,{"src":"/images/projects/askcart-analytics.webp","alt":"Live analytics against the study baseline: null results 8.0% vs 27.3%, 78.7% resolved within two follow-ups.","width":1280,"height":900,"sizes":"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px","priority":false}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","i",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":"03"}],"Live analytics against the study baseline: null results 8.0% vs 27.3%, 78.7% resolved within two follow-ups."]}]]}]]}]
1e:["$","aside",null,{"className":"hnotes","aria-label":"Margin notes","style":{"viewTransitionName":"post-notes-askcart"},"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"hn","children":[["$","svg",null,{"viewBox":"0 0 28 18","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$","path",null,{"d":"M26 14 C 20 4, 12 4, 3 9 M7 5 L3 9 L8 11"}]}],["$","b",null,{"children":"Pull quote"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["When the catalog returns nothing, the shopper doesn't file a ticket — ",["$","mark",null,{"children":"they just leave"}],"."]}]]}],[["$","div","The dataset",{"className":"hn","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The dataset"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"I started with the only dataset that would tell me the truth: reviews."}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#the-problem","children":["Read it in ","The problem"," ↓"]}]]}],["$","div","The fix",{"className":"hn","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The fix"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"null results fell from 27.3% to 8%"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#ask-don-t-guess","children":["Read it in ","Ask, don't guess"," ↓"]}]]}],["$","div","The guardrail",{"className":"hn","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The guardrail"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"the suite passes at 96.5% (n=113)"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"#evals-before-launch","children":["Read it in ","Evals before launch"," ↓"]}]]}]]]}]
1f:["$","div",null,{"className":"ms-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"prose","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"the-problem","children":"The problem"}],"\n",["$","div","p-0",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["AskCart started from a simple observation: e-commerce search fails silently. When the catalog returns nothing, the shopper doesn't file a ticket — ",["$","mark","0",{"className":"mk","children":"they just leave"}],". I wanted to see how often that happens and what the queries actually look like, so I started with the only dataset that would tell me the truth: reviews."]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","pq",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"Pull quote"}],["$","small",null,{"children":"Select any line to reply"}]]}],["$","span","The dataset",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The dataset"}],["$","i",null,{"children":"I started with the only dataset that would tell me the truth: reviews."}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"mining-94-600-reviews-for-signal","children":"Mining 94,600 reviews for signal"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":["I built an agentic extractor on the Reddit, App Store and Play Store APIs and fed it into a 6-stage SQL pipeline. Across 94.6K reviews it isolated four root causes of search failure: vague intent, missing filter context, spelling and slang drift, and catalog gaps that no query could ever fix. ",["$","mark","0",{"className":"mk","children":"Each cause got its own treatment instead of one generic \"no results\" page."}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-2",{"id":"ask-don-t-guess","children":"Ask, don't guess"}],"\n",["$","div","p-2",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"The product decision was to replace the dead end with a guided follow-up: a Vercel-deployed MVP over 54K Bayesian-rated SKUs that asks one narrow question at a time — budget, use case, must-have feature — and re-runs the search with the answer. On 150 real search sessions, null results fell from 27.3% to 8%."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","The fix",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The fix"}],["$","i",null,{"children":"null results fell from 27.3% to 8%"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-3",{"id":"when-the-model-is-the-fallback","children":"When the model is the fallback"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"A lot of the remaining misses were Hinglish: \"sneekrs red\", \"waterproof for monsoon\". I built an ML semantic fallback using multilingual embeddings for similarity search, so vague or code-mixed queries still resolve. On a 100-query eval set, top-3 relevance hit 88%."}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-4",{"id":"evals-before-launch","children":"Evals before launch"}],"\n",["$","div","p-4",{"className":"mp","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"On top of search I built a RAG chatbot on LLM intent parsing and embedding search. I wrote AI evals for search, RAG and UX before the first demo; the suite passes at 96.5% (n=113) and now guards every prompt and index change. User-level click and event analytics with properties show 78.7% of searches resolve within 2 follow-ups (n=150)."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mnotes","role":"note","children":[["$","span","The guardrail",{"className":"mnote","children":["$1e:props:children:0:props:children:0",["$","b",null,{"children":"The guardrail"}],["$","i",null,{"children":"the suite passes at 96.5% (n=113)"}]]}]]}]]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-5",{"id":"what-shipped","children":"What shipped"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":"Next.js front end, SQL pipeline, Python + ML fallback, Gemini API for the chat. What I'd do differently: instrument the funnel from day one, and budget the embeddings before it budgets me."}]]}]}]
20:["$","div",null,{"className":"enddesk an","children":[["$","$L32",null,{"heading":"Questions about how AskCart was built?","title":"AskCart","quote":"When the catalog returns nothing, the shopper doesn't file a ticket — they just leave."}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"rail","aria-label":"Next on the desk","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"rl","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"Next on the desk"}],["$","i",null,{"children":[2," ","pages"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pile","style":{"--n":2},"children":[["$","$L1c","insight-extractor",{"href":"/projects/insight-extractor","className":"pg","style":{"--k":0,"--r":"0.8deg","viewTransitionName":"post-paper-insight-extractor"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"pm","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Case study"}]," · 3 min read"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Insight Extractor"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sw","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"dk","children":"Agentic User Insight Engine"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"pq","children":["“","Strictly ≤3 Gemini calls per run (plan → label → synthesize).","”"]}]]}]]}],["$","$L1c","research-agent",{"href":"/projects/research-agent","className":"pg","style":{"--k":1,"--r":"-0.5deg","viewTransitionName":"post-paper-research-agent"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"pm","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Case study"}]," · 3 min read"]}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Research Agent"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"sw","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"dk","children":"An n8n Workflow That Turns Reddit and Hacker News into PRDs"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"pq","children":["“","I wanted that loop to run itself — give it a topic, get back a prioritized pile of pain points and a first draft of the work.","”"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]
